    AtomicPathSkippedRejectedCons(_, _, _, _, _, _, _, _, _, _, _, _, _, _, _, _, _, _, continuation, _, _) -> atomic_path_commit_after_failure_excludes_continuation(cause, continuation)

  ## Package-native base case for a later selected sibling. A local blocking
